Package: mica-apid
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mica build <mica@example.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: micad (= 0.1.0-5), mica-system
Description: Mica OS HTTPS API
 Serves the management API over HTTPS and changes the device only through
 micad, whose executable it runs under the name mica-apid. Starts at boot.
 The web console is the separate mica-apid-ui package.
